0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.7.1.stable\n\n> I have a solution ready, the bug was \"added\" 7 years ago, so it's not a regression. I'm creating this PR to help keep track of this bug in case my solution gets rejected.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev (3437479e6) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9227) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600H with Radeon Graphics (12 threads) - 31.34 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nLook at the first video. You can see that when I have multiple files selected and I edit anything, I can't edit it smoothly, and all properties get checked, which isn't the correct behaviour.\n\n## How it works with multiple files (incorrect)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b599cab9-f81d-44fd-afab-c73b09943417\n\n## How it works with single files (correct)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/958d90f6-7a1e-4497-a3f1-c313dbedb365\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the MRP\n2. Select both fonts\n3. Open the \"Import\" dock\n4. Try editing the oversampling for example\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30170061/MRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repite